title = "If you are wise..." 

[Overview]
<background="nsstart">
<h2>The first choice may decide your fate.</h2>
<p>
Let me tell you something {kinda like the directions}.  <br>
Needless to say, these are all seperate, stand alone, senerios.  They MAY lead up to huge campains though.
<br>
~mIslands at War 1-3 are the same thing except one thing:  The Great Teacher will only teach you one of three catorgories.  You get to pick.<br>
~w~Ia. The Three Cannons<br>
~[IsunCannon.*]~[IrainCannon.*]~[IthunderCannon.*]<br>
b. The three archers<br>
~[IsunArcher.*]~[IwindArcher.*]~[IthunderArcher.*]<br>
c. The three aviaries.<br> 
~.~[IwindAviary.*]~[IrainAviary.*]~[IsunAviary.*]<br> 
<br>
~yImpossible is a simple, one on one game with great defenses.  It may take awhile.<br>
~[Iwindblocker.*]~[Iwindblocker.*]~[Iwindblocker.*]~[Iwindblocker.*]~[Iwindblocker.*]<br>
<br>
~oTo The Death is an all attack map with no defenses.<br>
~[IthunderCannon.*]~[IrainCannon.*]~[Iwindarcher.*]~[Isunarcher.*]<br>
<br>
~bCrossroads is a regular two on two game.<br>
<br>
~rIf You are Brave is a run for your life map.<br>
~wFirst...~[Ipriest.*]Second...~[Ioutpost.*]Last...~[Iwindvortex.*]<br>
<br>
~gTell me what you think...    It helps us make maps.<br>
<br>
~kThe DeathWalker ~[Irune.1]<br>
~mVirtues8@juno.com......ICQ: 10359215......FletJef@naspa.com<br>
Read: Readme TooCool for more info.


